  m_Name: Order_Mid_Warm09
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Witch.Infrastructure::Witch.Infrastructure.Content.OrderDefinition
  stableId: order.mid.w09
  difficulty: 1
  orderBubbles:
  - A winter illness caused fever, exhaustion, and violent shivering.
  - Her blocked nose leaves her struggling to breathe.
  - Her heartbeat and lungs are strong, without chest wounds.
  - My mother prescribed Syzygium aromaticum for shivering.
  - She added Capsicum annuum for energy and blocked airways.
  firstHerbId: herb.clove
  secondHerbId: herb.cayennePepper
